# Docker always reads .dockerignore from the BUILD CONTEXT root, regardless
# of where the Dockerfile itself lives -- so this stays here even though
# Repertoire-Creator/Dockerfile builds with the repo root as its context.
# See Repertoire-Creator/README.md "Hosting it for free".
.git
.lichess
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pdf
Lichess-Study-to-PDF/engine
Lichess-Study-to-PDF/out
Lichess-Study-to-PDF/tests
Repertoire-Creator/tests
Player-Prepper/tests
Player-Prepper/prep
Player-Prepper/data
ChessAnalyzer/tests
Weakness-Report/tests
Weakness-Report/history
